@startuml
!include _seq-style.puml
title 3.5.3 AddCategory

actor "Admin / Manager" as A
boundary "Categories UI" as UI <<boundary>>
control "CategoryController" as CC <<control>>
control "CategoryService" as S <<service>>
entity "CategoryRepository" as R <<entity>>

== Add category ==
A -> UI: enter name + Save
activate UI
UI -> CC: POST /api/categories\n(CreateCategoryRequest)
activate CC
CC -> S: createCategory(request)
activate S
S -> R: save(category)
activate R
R --> S: Category
deactivate R
S --> CC: CategoryListItemResponse
deactivate S
CC --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate CC
UI --> A: add row
deactivate UI

@enduml
